#: ../../source/docs/ac2_positionmode.rst:5 51cb316298be49e6b11275020223ca19
msgid "Archived: Position Mode"
msgstr "已归档：Position 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_positionmode.rst:7 25c2889e204048ff87dbb41fc2bd6c04
msgid ""
"**Position mode** is the same as loiter mode, but with manual throttle "
"control. This means that, in position mode, the copter maintains a "
"consistent location and heading, while allowing the operator to control the "
"throttle manually."
msgstr ""
"**Position 模式** 与 Loiter 模式相同，但油门由手动控制。这意味着在 Position "
"模式下，飞机保持固定位置和航向，同时允许操作员手动控制油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_positionmode.rst:15 9693b79fba52463a9947748527d72acd
msgid ""
"Position mode is GPS dependent, so it is important to ensure that GPS is "
"locked before arming the copter when using this mode. GPS lock is indicated "
"by the following LED states:"
msgstr "Position 模式依赖 GPS，因此在使用此模式解锁飞机前务必确认 GPS 已锁定。GPS 锁定状态由以下 LED 状态指示："

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_positionmode.rst:19 65fc14ab8e0343c28c57308749565e22
msgid "Blue LED on APM is solid."
msgstr "APM 上的蓝色 LED 常亮。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_positionmode.rst:20 68c7c6a42f2a4f77a6d79d11c802bd3a
msgid "Blue LED on GPS module is solid."
msgstr "GPS 模块上的蓝色 LED 常亮。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_positionmode.rst:21 e2a79564e8ca42e99040840069544891
msgid "Blue LED on GPS+Compass module is blinking."
msgstr "GPS+罗盘模块上的蓝色 LED 闪烁。"
